@startuml ci-verification
!pragma layout smetana
title Windows CI - verification and evidence
start
:Push main / ci branch, PR or manual run;
:Checkout exact revision;
:Record workflow and runner identity;
:Install SDK from global.json;
:Check MSVC, Windows SDK, C++/CLI,
Java 11 and pinned PlantUML hash;
if (Environment ready?) then (yes)
  :Run existing verify.ps1;
  :Native + managed + C++/CLI builds;
  :217 mandatory cases, CLI / IPC / publish,
architecture and documentation;
  if (All checks pass?) then (yes)
    :Report Passed;
  else (no)
    :Report Verification failure;
  endif
else (no)
  :Report Preflight / setup failure;
endif
:Always attempt evidence upload;
:Retain environment, summary, TRX,
manifest and logs for 14 days;
note right
No automatic merge or deployment.
Runner loss can prevent upload.
end note
stop
@enduml
